{"id":"53b7db311f","t":"Chronicles of the Lazy Sovereign","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/190412377434382658-193x278.jpg","n":73,"l":73,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign"},"u":1795038077171,"desc":"[بقلم نفس المؤلف الذي قدّم لكم عودة طائفة جبل هوا!] هو البطل العظيم الذي وضع حدًّا للفوضى التي عمّت أرجاء العالم… وي يونهو، سيّد الفنون القتالية المتألّق، الذي نُسجت حوله الأساطير وتغنّت بذكره الألسن. عُرف بين الناس بالنُّبل والشهامة، وبأنه فارس لا يشقّ له غبار… لكن الحقيقة؟ “ذلك الرجل؟ نذل… نذلٌ بكل ما تحمله الكلمة من معنى.” السرّ الصادم، الذي عُتم عليه طويلًا وأُخفي عن أعين العالم خجلًا وعارًا، آن الأوان أخيرًا لكشف الستار عن الوجه الآخر لأعظم فارس في التاريخ!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","فنون قتاليه","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/1/"},"2":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/2/"},"3":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/3/"},"4":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/4/"},"5":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/5/"},"6":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/6/"},"7":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/7/"},"8":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/8/"},"9":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/9/"},"10":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/10/"},"11":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/11/"},"12":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/12/"},"13":{"ml":"chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign|/manga/chronicles-of-the-lazy-sovereign/13/"},"14":{"ml":